AMBARI-21582 - Stack Tools and Feature Should be Ignored in
 Blueprints (jonathanhurley)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the `BlueprintConfigurationProcessor` incorrectly checking for properties in the broader `defaultStackProperties` map instead of the specific `clusterEnvDefaultProperties` map. This led to the inclusion of stack tools and features in blueprints, which should have been ignored according to the intended functionality.

